%% model: gemini_3_8_flash
%% prompt: 27. Processing a photographer's export job (prompts.md)
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Queued

    Queued --> Running : Dequeue Job
    Queued --> Cancelled : Cancel Request

    state Running {
        [*] --> ForkState
        state ForkState <<fork>>
        ForkState --> ImageRendering
        ForkState --> MetadataPackaging

        state JoinState <<join>>
        ImageRendering --> JoinState : Render Complete
        MetadataPackaging --> JoinState : Package Complete

        JoinState --> Uploading

        state Uploading {
            [*] --> Transferring
            Transferring --> UploadError : Network Drop or 5xx
            UploadError --> Transferring : Retry [Attempts < MaxRetries]
            UploadError --> UploadExhausted : Max Retries Exceeded
            Transferring --> UploadSuccess : HTTP 200 OK
            UploadSuccess --> [*]
        }
    }

    Running --> Paused : Pause Request [Preserve Context]
    Paused --> Running : Resume Request [Restore Interrupted Stage]

    Running --> Cancelled : Cancel Request
    Paused --> Cancelled : Cancel Request

    Uploading --> Failed : UploadExhausted
    Uploading --> Completed : UploadSuccess

    Completed --> [*]
    Failed --> [*]
    Cancelled --> [*]

    note right of Running
        Retained Artifacts for Retries:
        - Rendered image binaries on local disk
        - Packaged EXIF and metadata sidecar files
        - S3 multipart upload ID and uploaded parts map
    end note
